9. PRIVACY AND THE LICENCE CHECK
   The licence check runs on Your computer. It reads and writes two small local files that record the first-start date and
   the latest date seen (app/photobooth-data/.seesaw-trial.json and .seesaw/trial.json in Your user folder) and reads
   app/licence/. It does not connect to the internet and does not send any information to the Licensor.

